(1069632, 129120, 15811, '<td valign="top">Dr. Jones?  haha j/k looks like a classy holiday decoration to me ;-)</td>', 'Dr. Jones?  haha j/k looks like a classy holiday decoration to me ;-)', '2004-12-20 00:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069637, 129479, 21724, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!!!  i love it :)  i would have preferred to have the starburst over to the left a little bit, more in the corner to add a sense fo balance, but it''s still a beautiful picture!!  9 :)</td>', 'gorgeous!!!  i love it :)  i would have preferred to have the starburst over to the left a little bit, more in the corner to add a sense fo balance, but it''s still a beautiful picture!!  9 :)', '2004-12-20 00:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069641, 129465, 21724, '<td valign="top">I was always taught that blur is effective only as long as SOMETHING is sharp in the picture.. Unfortunately, nothing here is :(</td>', 'I was always taught that blur is effective only as long as SOMETHING is sharp in the picture.. Unfortunately, nothing here is :(', '2004-12-20 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069649, 128965, 21724, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this.. It would be nicer if the background were consistent, instead of darkening at the top.. Still a nice photo!</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this.. It would be nicer if the background were consistent, instead of darkening at the top.. Still a nice photo!', '2004-12-20 00:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069662, 129278, 21724, '<td valign="top">fun picture, but it would have been far more impressive had you used a human face and oversized christmas lights (the big bulb ones) to achieve the same effect.  i personally prefer borders, and I think one would improve this pic, but I certainly wont consider that in my voting.  Good picture, very creative!!!! 8</td>', 'fun picture, but it would have been far more impressive had you used a human face and oversized christmas lights (the big bulb ones) to achieve the same effect.  i personally prefer borders, and I think one would improve this pic, but I certainly wont consider that in my voting.  Good picture, very creative!!!! 8', '2004-12-20 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069666, 129181, 21724, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot, but the red and blues are really distracting.  i recommend cloning out inconsistencies like that!</td>', 'gorgeous shot, but the red and blues are really distracting.  i recommend cloning out inconsistencies like that!', '2004-12-20 00:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069676, 129174, 21724, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2004-12-20 00:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069678, 129366, 3102, '<td valign="top">With the hymnal being turned the other way, this feels upside-down to me... but it''s an otherwise nice shot :)</td>', 'With the hymnal being turned the other way, this feels upside-down to me... but it''s an otherwise nice shot :)', '2004-12-20 00:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069680, 129303, 21724, '<td valign="top">HAHA, cute title!! that house is INSANE!!  I''m not sure if I would classify this as "classy," though ;)  on the technical side, i would have cloned out that wire on the right, it''s rather distracting</td>', 'HAHA, cute title!! that house is INSANE!!  I''m not sure if I would classify this as "classy," though ;)  on the technical side, i would have cloned out that wire on the right, it''s rather distracting', '2004-12-20 00:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069685, 129433, 21724, '<td valign="top">the truck in the background seems really random and distracting.. is there a purpose in it that i''m not getting, or did you just have no way around it in order to get the shot you wanted?</td>', 'the truck in the background seems really random and distracting.. is there a purpose in it that i''m not getting, or did you just have no way around it in order to get the shot you wanted?', '2004-12-20 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069692, 128998, 21724, '<td valign="top">perfectly symmetrical and aligned.. no small feat!  good job!  <br/> <br/>i''ve always been taught that in photography, your eye is drawn immediately to either a) the area of greatest dark/light contrast, or b) the most dramatic color.  In this case, unfortunately, that''s your border.  A border should add to the picture subtly, not distract from it dramatically.  I would suggest next time using a tiny red border and a think black or white border instead.</td>', 'perfectly symmetrical and aligned.. no small feat!  good job!   i''ve always been taught that in photography, your eye is drawn immediately to either a) the area of greatest dark/light contrast, or b) the most dramatic color.  In this case, unfortunately, that''s your border.  A border should add to the picture subtly, not distract from it dramatically.  I would suggest next time using a tiny red border and a think black or white border instead.', '2004-12-20 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069699, 129289, 21724, '<td valign="top">cute, but I think it would have been smarter to focus on the bell, which to me is more visually interesting.  either way, very well composed.  nice shot!</td>', 'cute, but I think it would have been smarter to focus on the bell, which to me is more visually interesting.  either way, very well composed.  nice shot!', '2004-12-20 00:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069707, 128998, 3102, '<td valign="top">Whoa... turn down the border!  Seriously, it really takes away from the shot...</td>', 'Whoa... turn down the border!  Seriously, it really takes away from the shot...', '2004-12-20 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069712, 129480, 21724, '<td valign="top">well shot, just not that visually interesting</td>', 'well shot, just not that visually interesting', '2004-12-20 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
