(1070178, 129335, 18799, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice image.  I don''t know that is fits my idea of a holiday decoration, other than the tradional colors.</td>', 'It''s a very nice image.  I don''t know that is fits my idea of a holiday decoration, other than the tradional colors.', '2004-12-20 07:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
