(1075364, 129428, 21724, '<td valign="top">this photo is really simple, which isn''t inherently bad, but when you do have just one subject you need to do something else to help.. the shadows are a very nice touch, but an off-centered composition (per the rule of thirds) would have been more effective.</td>', 'this photo is really simple, which isn''t inherently bad, but when you do have just one subject you need to do something else to help.. the shadows are a very nice touch, but an off-centered composition (per the rule of thirds) would have been more effective.', '2004-12-23 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075373, 129371, 21724, '<td valign="top">wonderful!!  i''ve tried this effect myself several times, and I could never get it to look right, but you''ve managed to do it fantastically!  i don''t see this one as a winner, but I do think it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'wonderful!!  i''ve tried this effect myself several times, and I could never get it to look right, but you''ve managed to do it fantastically!  i don''t see this one as a winner, but I do think it''s a nice shot.', '2004-12-23 13:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
