(1076019, 129051, 30861, '<td valign="top">a little too literal in the rendition to convey any mood to me. I wish I could see all of the wings, also</td>', 'a little too literal in the rendition to convey any mood to me. I wish I could see all of the wings, also', '2004-12-23 22:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076034, 129120, 10658, '<td valign="top">Happy Holidays indeed!  9</td>', 'Happy Holidays indeed!  9', '2004-12-23 23:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076105, 129120, 22479, '<td valign="top">Sorry, to say this is a holiday (Christmas) decoration is a latex stretch. :-)</td>', 'Sorry, to say this is a holiday (Christmas) decoration is a latex stretch. :-)', '2004-12-24 01:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076111, 129467, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ohh....very pretty. I like the backlighting and most of all the shadow of the star. Very tastefully composed. <br/> <br/>Detracting issues: <br/>- Appears to be a horizontal (to axis of sensor) banding noise pattern reminescent of a Canon 20D probably due to the use of a faster ISO setting. <br/>- Image has a lot of detail, but there is significant jaggies due to very strong edge sharpening. Consequently, overall image integrity has been compromised to a degree.<br/>- Colors are just a bit flat. Could have been spruced up with a quick saturation adjustment. I like the colors and the warm color balance...this is really a minor issue.<br/> <br/>Overall, this is a very good submission. I will rank this as one of my top picks.</td>', 'Ohh....very pretty. I like the backlighting and most of all the shadow of the star. Very tastefully composed.  Detracting issues: - Appears to be a horizontal (to axis of sensor) banding noise pattern reminescent of a Canon 20D probably due to the use of a faster ISO setting. - Image has a lot of detail, but there is significant jaggies due to very strong edge sharpening. Consequently, overall image integrity has been compromised to a degree.- Colors are just a bit flat. Could have been spruced up with a quick saturation adjustment. I like the colors and the warm color balance...this is really a minor issue. Overall, this is a very good submission. I will rank this as one of my top picks.', '2004-12-24 01:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076112, 129319, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite magical indeed. I like the color saturation. The soft focus creates a dreamy glow which contributes to a fantastic and appropriate entry for this challenge. I wonder if this image could be further refined by setting the black point higher, thereby increasing dark contrast. Just a thought. Very good entry overall.</td>', 'Quite magical indeed. I like the color saturation. The soft focus creates a dreamy glow which contributes to a fantastic and appropriate entry for this challenge. I wonder if this image could be further refined by setting the black point higher, thereby increasing dark contrast. Just a thought. Very good entry overall.', '2004-12-24 01:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076113, 129366, 22479, '<td valign="top">I can see you, and your setup in the reflection. :-)<br/> <br/>I like the soft focus and the lighting in this entry. Quite superbly executed. Exposure is spot on perfect. Overall a wonderful composition and a strong contender in this challenge.</td>', 'I can see you, and your setup in the reflection. :-) I like the soft focus and the lighting in this entry. Quite superbly executed. Exposure is spot on perfect. Overall a wonderful composition and a strong contender in this challenge.', '2004-12-24 01:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076116, 129376, 22479, '<td valign="top">Strong entry, aesthetically pleasing and well composed. On technical issues, the image integrity has been compromised by oversharpening which resulted in image artifacts. Furthermore, the sharpening you applied to this image also sharpened the visible noise creating a rather gritty appearance to the ornaments. Ultimately, though, this is as I said earlier, quite a pleasing entry and I feel should do well. Good luck!</td>', 'Strong entry, aesthetically pleasing and well composed. On technical issues, the image integrity has been compromised by oversharpening which resulted in image artifacts. Furthermore, the sharpening you applied to this image also sharpened the visible noise creating a rather gritty appearance to the ornaments. Ultimately, though, this is as I said earlier, quite a pleasing entry and I feel should do well. Good luck!', '2004-12-24 01:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076117, 129117, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the soft focus. Exposure is excellent and I think the saturation and color balance is perfect. A very tasteful and aesthetic presentation. <br/> <br/>I feel it was a shame that you added this border. IMO, it does nothing for this image, and is quite a distraction. Ultimately, this is not a major issue and does not warrant a major deduction in your score.</td>', 'Love the soft focus. Exposure is excellent and I think the saturation and color balance is perfect. A very tasteful and aesthetic presentation.  I feel it was a shame that you added this border. IMO, it does nothing for this image, and is quite a distraction. Ultimately, this is not a major issue and does not warrant a major deduction in your score.', '2004-12-24 01:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076119, 129051, 22479, '<td valign="top">Image tastefully sharpened and scene is very aesthetically pleasing. I suggest increasing the black point to black out the curtain in the backdrop. Otherwise, this is a very strong contender in this challenge.</td>', 'Image tastefully sharpened and scene is very aesthetically pleasing. I suggest increasing the black point to black out the curtain in the backdrop. Otherwise, this is a very strong contender in this challenge.', '2004-12-24 01:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076123, 129297, 22479, '<td valign="top">Stunning presentation. Aesthetically pleasing, very creative, and very elegant.<br/> <br/>Technically and artistically beyond reproach. I predict this will earn a ribbon. Good luck!</td>', 'Stunning presentation. Aesthetically pleasing, very creative, and very elegant. Technically and artistically beyond reproach. I predict this will earn a ribbon. Good luck!', '2004-12-24 01:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076124, 129401, 22479, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, effect.<br/> <br/>Technically beyond reproach (well, almost. Reflection a bit strong on the ornament)<br/> <br/>Artistically beyond reproach.<br/> <br/>Border could have been more subtle but not sufficiently detracting to be an issue at all.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a well deserved ribbon (well that''s my prediction :-)<br/></td>', 'Simple, elegant, effect. Technically beyond reproach (well, almost. Reflection a bit strong on the ornament) Artistically beyond reproach. Border could have been more subtle but not sufficiently detracting to be an issue at all. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon (well that''s my prediction :-)', '2004-12-24 01:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076125, 129357, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very fitting for this challenge, and very classy presentation. Technically beyond reproach, and if I were to nit pick, I''d comment that the image exposure is a bit blown but that is not enough to seriously detract from the beauty of this presentation. One other comment. I feel that a simple border would have sufficed here. Yet, your border if not sufficiently tacky to be an issue. Overall a strong entry that I hope does well. Good luck.</td>', 'Very fitting for this challenge, and very classy presentation. Technically beyond reproach, and if I were to nit pick, I''d comment that the image exposure is a bit blown but that is not enough to seriously detract from the beauty of this presentation. One other comment. I feel that a simple border would have sufficed here. Yet, your border if not sufficiently tacky to be an issue. Overall a strong entry that I hope does well. Good luck.', '2004-12-24 01:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
