(1076700, 129117, 25655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and sure is classy/<br/>It is hard to say if the focus is soft or the bells are too sharp that it''s just reflection. In any case, it is very warm and merry.</td>', 'Beautiful and sure is classy/It is hard to say if the focus is soft or the bells are too sharp that it''s just reflection. In any case, it is very warm and merry.', '2004-12-24 17:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
