(1077857, 129228, 15207, '<td valign="top">Classy elegant - fits the description perfectly. Plus, a beautifully composed shot. Screams the holidays. Really excellent work. Love the detail coming through. caught at the perfect time of day. Good luck. I think you''ll do well.</td>', 'Classy elegant - fits the description perfectly. Plus, a beautifully composed shot. Screams the holidays. Really excellent work. Love the detail coming through. caught at the perfect time of day. Good luck. I think you''ll do well.', '2004-12-26 15:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
