(1077964, 129402, 18799, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this rotated a few degrees cw.  That would have made the center stucture vertical and create a symetry in the image.  As is, it seems off balance to me.   Still, 7 becuase I like the subject, sharpeness and exposure.<br/>Returning for final view - bumping to 8</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this rotated a few degrees cw.  That would have made the center stucture vertical and create a symetry in the image.  As is, it seems off balance to me.   Still, 7 becuase I like the subject, sharpeness and exposure.Returning for final view - bumping to 8', '2004-12-26 17:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
