(1078223, 129120, 4564, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments - and I appologize for the confusion this image has stirred up regarding the challenge theme.  After 24 hours, I emailed site council tobe disqualified from the challenge.  It occured to me that I had taken the theme way too largely and the photo I submitted should have been disqualified.  I was told that they don''t accept self disqualification requests and that it would be up to the voters to decide.  Fair enough.<br/>Cheers, and happy holidays!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments - and I appologize for the confusion this image has stirred up regarding the challenge theme.  After 24 hours, I emailed site council tobe disqualified from the challenge.  It occured to me that I had taken the theme way too largely and the photo I submitted should have been disqualified.  I was told that they don''t accept self disqualification requests and that it would be up to the voters to decide.  Fair enough.Cheers, and happy holidays!', '2004-12-27 00:06:29.000000', NULL, 0),
