(1079723, 129303, 4178, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ion:</b></div><hr/><i> you must be joking!!! That''s brilliant! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Just realised what I wrote could be taken in two different ways. For clarification, I think it''s a great shot and title - i just find it amazing that this house exists in reality, and think it''s fantastic that this is captured on film.<br/> <br/>(not that you must be kidding if you think it''s brilliant...)<br/> <br/>All clear? Great!<br/>Ion</td>', 'Originally posted by Ion: you must be joking!!! That''s brilliant!  Just realised what I wrote could be taken in two different ways. For clarification, I think it''s a great shot and title - i just find it amazing that this house exists in reality, and think it''s fantastic that this is captured on film. (not that you must be kidding if you think it''s brilliant...) All clear? Great!Ion', '2004-12-28 07:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
