(1176509, 129195, 28359, '<td valign="top">OK, had to comment on this alone....LOL   actually, this was a good learning shot for me. 1st time trying to get a solid black background.<br/>was in the very first stages of learning a little about photoshop 7. Now thats the only program I use. One more challenge will make it #20. I used this site for creative / learning purposes. Pretty OK with the average score. Now I believe the next 20 is not to just please myself, but make my shots more appealing to the majority. Lets see how it goes............<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-16 23:48:56.</i></td>', 'OK, had to comment on this alone....LOL   actually, this was a good learning shot for me. 1st time trying to get a solid black background.was in the very first stages of learning a little about photoshop 7. Now thats the only program I use. One more challenge will make it #20. I used this site for creative / learning purposes. Pretty OK with the average score. Now I believe the next 20 is not to just please myself, but make my shots more appealing to the majority. Lets see how it goes............', '2005-02-16 23:47:44.000000', '2005-02-16 23:48:56.000000', 0),
(1225950, 129397, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple with the house nicely separated from the blackness around it. It''s obvious but the biggest problem with this image is the tree that obscures the house. And the fact that it''s hard to get rid of the tree doesn''t stop it spoiling the image. Perhaps standing to the left and re-shooting would have helped.</td>', 'Nice and simple with the house nicely separated from the blackness around it. It''s obvious but the biggest problem with this image is the tree that obscures the house. And the fact that it''s hard to get rid of the tree doesn''t stop it spoiling the image. Perhaps standing to the left and re-shooting would have helped.', '2005-03-14 05:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
